I'm not experienced with these things,
but I'll try my best for you...

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.280
-I...
-Hold on.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.610
Calm down, Kosaka.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:47.870
Shinozaki!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.210
Knock down the stick game?

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.050
Wow!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:03.430
That means we'd all have to
participate for this one...

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:05.430
Really? I'll do it!

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:09.140
Wait a second.
Shinozaki's stick is mine and mine alone.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.680
You shouldn't be so strict
considering the circumstances.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.980
Yeah, we need to get it all hard first.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.020
Jeez!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.030
I'm not doing this!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.240
Ms. Koshimizu!

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:28.780
So you guys haven't started
doing anything yet?

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:33.040
I thought you'd be all
over each other by now.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.790
What are you saying?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.300
You're not passing this
class until you do it.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.210
I have one more special one.

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:46.220
I have a "balls and rod" game.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.340
It's called...

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:47.720
<i>Stick Game</i>

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.100
The Stick Game!
<i>Stick Game</i>

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:49.140
The Stick Game!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.310
No more of that.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:54.640
Jeez...

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:56.400
But Shinozaki...

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.690
Our review lesson isn't over yet.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:00.520
Huh?

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:02.940
Yeah, Akiho is right.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.780
Yeah, that's right, Brother!

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.280
No complaints!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.780
That can't be...

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.780
If you don't like Ms.
Koshimizu's game,

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.830
then let's play a game I thought of.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:16.040
What type of game is that?

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.630
Well...

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.380
You'll just have to find out someday.
